# ---- coordination DB (harness-jobs worker) ----
# The shared ledger every box coordinates through (worker/jobs; see
# docs/DB-COORDINATION-SPEC.md). EMPTY means "not configured": every jobs-client
# call fails open to per-box files with no network request, and logs/jobs-client.log
# says so once a day (never ALERTS.log).
# Joining an existing fleet: get the URL from the fleet operator.
# Running your own fleet: deploy worker/jobs and put its URL here.
JOBS_URL=
